* NJM3404A single-supply bipolar dual op-amp (an improved NJM2904/LM358), 36 V max: the Boss DS-1's (our model from Nisshinbo's sheet)
* Built by Solum Builder from Nisshinbo Micro Devices NJM3404A data sheet (Ver. 20260723), at ±15 V and at a single 5 V; phase margin assumed (D-169) (D-162)
.subckt NJM3404A 1 2 3 4 5
* pins: + - V+ V- out. Built by Solum Builder from the sheet's typical figures (D-162)
Rin 1 2 1e+12
Rc1 1 mid 1e12
Rc2 2 mid 1e12
Emid mid 4 3 4 0.5
Bgm mid g I=1e-05*tanh(7.2552*(V(1)-V(2)))
R1 g mid 1.37832e+09
C1 g mid 8.33333e-12
Vhp 3 hp DC 0.95
Vhn hn 4 DC 0.005
Dhi g hp DCLAMP
Dlo hn g DCLAMP
Ebuf b 0 g 0 1
Rp b p 1000
Cp p 0 7.65735e-11
Eout o 0 p 0 1
Vsense o o2 0
Rout o2 5 10
Bsrc 3 0 I=max(i(Vsense),0)
Bsnk 0 4 I=max(-i(Vsense),0)
Iq 3 4 DC 0.001
.model DCLAMP D(is=1e-15 n=0.05)
.ends
